        "id": "poison-dispute",
        "title": "A poison dispute notification",
        "description": "Adyen starts sending a new dispute format. The Disputes handler can't parse it: each one fails three times and lands in the PSP events DLQ, while charge updates in the same queue keep flowing. After the fix ships, redrive replays the parked disputes.",
